<p> </p>
<table><tbody><tr><td class="msmsboards" width="48%">取締役会長&#xff1a;</td><td class="msmsboards">尾藤 大祐</td></tr><tr><td class="msmsboards">代表取締役社長&#xff1a;</td><td class="msmsboards">田村 浩四郎 (アルベルト)</td></tr><tr><td class="msmsboards">取締役&#xff1a;</td><td class="msmsboards">塙 龍一郎</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td class="msmsboards">長谷川 友紀</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td class="msmsboards">本城 史朗</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td class="msmsboards">角間 英樹</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td class="msmsboards">ケン・マーナー</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td class="msmsboards">長戸 夏恵</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td class="msmsboards">露﨑 剛志</td></tr><tr><td> </td><td class="msmsboards">梅津 ⾹織</td></tr><tr><td class="msmsboards">監査役&#xff1a;</td><td class="msmsboards">猪鼻 孝夫</td></tr></tbody></table>
